11
00:02:31,159 --> 00:02:32,879
I almost cried.

12
00:02:33,199 --> 00:02:34,840
Just kidding.

13
00:02:34,840 --> 00:02:36,240
To liven things up.

14
00:02:36,639 --> 00:02:37,800
Don't worry.

15
00:02:37,800 --> 00:02:40,280
The school has allowed me to stay.

16
00:02:40,879 --> 00:02:42,000
Really?

17
00:02:44,560 --> 00:02:45,199
Alright.

18
00:02:45,919 --> 00:02:46,759
Enough playing.

19
00:02:47,080 --> 00:02:47,960
Let's get down to business.

20
00:02:48,960 --> 00:02:49,960
The school

21
00:02:49,960 --> 00:02:50,800
has allowed us to continue

22
00:02:50,800 --> 00:02:51,960
