25
00:02:55,159 --> 00:02:56,759
Then we must give it our all.

26
00:02:57,240 --> 00:02:58,400
Do you have confidence?

27
00:02:58,400 --> 00:02:59,159
Yes!

28
00:02:59,159 --> 00:02:59,759
Good!

29
00:03:00,039 --> 00:03:02,479
