30
00:03:04,599 --> 00:03:06,199
Yudong is indeed strong,

31
00:03:06,719 --> 00:03:07,800
but on the field,

32
00:03:07,800 --> 00:03:08,599
there are always stories

33
00:03:08,599 --> 00:03:10,280
