36
00:03:20,879 --> 00:03:22,439
Hurry up, guys.

37
00:03:22,800 --> 00:03:24,360
Hurry up.

38
00:03:37,680 --> 00:03:38,439
Chen Song.

39
00:03:40,719 --> 00:03:42,159
Hello, we meet again.

40
00:03:42,719 --> 00:03:44,280
I heard you transferred to our class.

41
00:03:44,280 --> 00:03:45,719
We're classmates from now on.

42
00:03:45,719 --> 00:03:46,360
Really?

43
00:03:46,719 --> 00:03:47,919
Then we'll go to class together,

44
00:03:47,919 --> 00:03:48,759
and play basketball together.

45
00:03:50,080 --> 00:03:51,479
Coach Su asked me to take you there.

46
00:03:51,479 --> 00:03:52,719
They are all waiting for you.

47
00:03:53,039 --> 00:03:53,639
Let's go.

48
00:03:53,879 --> 00:03:54,520
OK.

49
00:04:09,199 --> 00:04:11,560
This is the secret weapon I mentioned.

50
00:04:12,080 --> 00:04:13,560
Xie Yizhou

51
00:04:14,719 --> 00:04:15,680
will join our basketball club

52
00:04:16,199 --> 00:04:18,120
