56
00:04:24,120 --> 00:04:25,639
What are you up to?

57
00:04:25,920 --> 00:04:27,319
That's so mean.

58
00:04:27,680 --> 00:04:28,600
I've decided to

59
00:04:28,600 --> 00:04:29,759
