78
00:05:14,560 --> 00:05:15,120
Come on.

79
00:05:15,399 --> 00:05:17,720
Welcome.

80
00:05:22,560 --> 00:05:23,480
Where's Fu Binyan?

81
00:05:51,600 --> 00:05:52,720
Dr. Qin said

82
00:05:52,879 --> 00:05:53,560
