88
00:06:01,759 --> 00:06:03,040
This match is very important.

89
00:06:03,279 --> 00:06:04,439
I want to be there.

90
00:06:15,120 --> 00:06:16,240
Come on.

91
00:06:16,240 --> 00:06:17,800
Let's take a picture together.

92
00:06:17,959 --> 00:06:18,639
Come on.

93
00:06:19,959 --> 00:06:22,279
