94
00:06:26,279 --> 00:06:27,040
Good.

95
00:06:27,040 --> 00:06:28,040
Your skills have improved.

96
00:06:28,040 --> 00:06:28,560
Yeah.

97
00:06:28,639 --> 00:06:30,040
