115
00:07:04,199 --> 00:07:05,160
What?

116
00:07:05,759 --> 00:07:06,720
Why is this happening?

117
00:07:08,240 --> 00:07:09,920
The school is just following the rules.

118
00:07:10,279 --> 00:07:11,279
There's nothing we can do.

119
00:07:20,959 --> 00:07:21,759
Is there really no other way

120
00:07:21,759 --> 00:07:23,199
to turn this around?

121
00:07:32,800 --> 00:07:35,079
But I have an idea.

122
00:07:36,040 --> 00:07:37,120
Maybe it can help Coach Su

123
00:07:37,519 --> 00:07:38,759
get back on his feet.

124
00:07:41,199 --> 00:07:41,879
Here we go,

125
00:07:42,240 --> 00:07:42,920
the moment I've been

126
00:07:42,920 --> 00:07:44,240
looking forward to!

127
00:07:45,040 --> 00:07:46,199
You're exaggerating.

128
00:07:48,759 --> 00:07:49,399
[Zhou Yang,]

129
00:07:49,800 --> 00:07:51,040
[do you remember]

130
00:07:51,040 --> 00:07:51,639
[the student file]

131
00:07:51,639 --> 00:07:52,800
[we looked through?]

132
00:07:53,199 --> 00:07:53,839
Of course.

133
00:07:54,439 --> 00:07:55,639
I've found

134
00:07:55,639 --> 00:07:56,879
the person you're looking for.

135
00:07:57,639 --> 00:07:58,560
Really?

136
00:08:00,360 --> 00:08:01,079
Can you two

137
00:08:01,079 --> 00:08:02,639
stop encrypting your calls?

138
00:08:03,079 --> 00:08:03,839
Everyone,

139
00:08:03,839 --> 00:08:04,959
listen to me.

140
00:08:05,279 --> 00:08:06,240
We don't have

141
00:08:06,680 --> 00:08:07,560
much time left.

142
00:08:20,680 --> 00:08:21,639
Coach.

143
00:08:21,639 --> 00:08:22,439
Hello, Coach.

144
00:08:23,199 --> 00:08:24,079
Why did you

145
00:08:24,079 --> 00:08:25,839
call me over on the weekend?

146
00:08:25,839 --> 00:08:27,040
And why is it such a big deal?

147
00:08:28,920 --> 00:08:29,759
Coach,

148
00:08:30,639 --> 00:08:32,240
