149
00:08:33,559 --> 00:08:34,480
Coach

150
00:08:34,720 --> 00:08:36,440
We will definitely practice hard.

151
00:08:37,519 --> 00:08:38,799
But

152
00:08:41,759 --> 00:08:42,559
coach

153
00:08:44,600 --> 00:08:46,080
we have a gift for you.

154
00:08:47,240 --> 00:08:47,960
Gift?

155
00:08:49,679 --> 00:08:50,559
What gift?

156
00:08:52,039 --> 00:08:54,480
Show yourself.

157
00:09:09,399 --> 00:09:10,279
Long time no see.

158
00:09:10,279 --> 00:09:11,679
Captain Sun

159
00:09:11,679 --> 00:09:13,240
We are all acquaintances.

160
00:09:13,440 --> 00:09:14,559
What brings you here?

161
00:09:14,559 --> 00:09:15,080
Ask him.

162
00:09:15,960 --> 00:09:17,039
We found

163
00:09:17,039 --> 00:09:17,399
