167
00:09:21,720 --> 00:09:22,960
I didn't know you were

168
00:09:22,960 --> 00:09:24,240
part of the basketball club.

169
00:09:24,720 --> 00:09:26,039
That's all history.

170
00:09:26,399 --> 00:09:28,120
When the kids said you were leaving,

171
00:09:28,120 --> 00:09:29,039
I disagreed.

172
00:09:29,039 --> 00:09:30,159
You can't leave the school

173
00:09:30,159 --> 00:09:31,200
without my permission.

174
00:09:32,639 --> 00:09:34,159
When I heard about the club,

175
00:09:34,159 --> 00:09:35,639
I came here right away.

176
00:09:35,639 --> 00:09:37,159
I'll be off soon.

177
00:09:38,000 --> 00:09:38,360
Captain,

178
00:09:38,360 --> 00:09:40,279
we haven't seen each other for years.

179
00:09:40,279 --> 00:09:41,840
Look at us now.

180
00:09:41,840 --> 00:09:42,480
You

181
00:09:42,480 --> 00:09:43,480
You've kept in good shape.

182
00:09:43,480 --> 00:09:44,080
Always maintaining

183
00:09:44,080 --> 00:09:45,440
