184
00:09:46,759 --> 00:09:47,360
Right.

185
00:09:47,360 --> 00:09:48,799
I never thought I'd come back here,

186
00:09:49,080 --> 00:09:49,720
and stand on the same basketball court

187
00:09:49,720 --> 00:09:50,799
