188
00:09:50,799 --> 00:09:51,759
It's really great.

189
00:09:54,240 --> 00:09:54,840
Coach, look at me.

190
00:09:54,840 --> 00:09:55,399
Come on.

191
00:09:56,600 --> 00:09:57,600
It's so memorable.

192
00:09:57,840 --> 00:09:58,159
Come on.

193
00:09:58,720 --> 00:09:59,960
Look, the coach is about to cry.

194
00:10:00,799 --> 00:10:01,600
One more.

195
00:10:01,679 --> 00:10:03,399
He must be moved to tears.

196
00:10:03,799 --> 00:10:04,600
That's great.

197
00:10:05,919 --> 00:10:06,320
Coach,

198
00:10:06,840 --> 00:10:07,840
