199
00:10:13,120 --> 00:10:14,120
Jersey?

200
00:10:14,120 --> 00:10:14,919
What do you mean?

201
00:10:14,919 --> 00:10:16,200
Of course, it's for playing basketball.

202
00:10:16,480 --> 00:10:17,240
Today,

203
00:10:17,240 --> 00:10:18,240
we're having

204
00:10:18,240 --> 00:10:20,120
