205
00:10:20,120 --> 00:10:21,000
Are you ready?

206
00:10:21,399 --> 00:10:22,840
Yes!

207
00:10:27,360 --> 00:10:28,720
Bring it on!

208
00:10:29,480 --> 00:10:30,159
Come on!

209
00:10:51,679 --> 00:10:52,440
Nice shot!

210
00:11:16,759 --> 00:11:17,519
Wow!

211
00:11:18,360 --> 00:11:20,240
The old team is so good!

212
00:12:08,960 --> 00:12:09,879
Nice shot!

213
00:12:12,159 --> 00:12:12,679
Captain,

214
00:12:12,679 --> 00:12:14,080
