215
00:12:19,600 --> 00:12:21,120
If they keep playing like this,

216
00:12:21,120 --> 00:12:21,919
our team

217
00:12:21,919 --> 00:12:22,960
will be outplayed.

218
00:12:23,360 --> 00:12:24,159
No way.

219
00:12:24,759 --> 00:12:25,759
Trust them.

220
00:12:44,519 --> 00:12:45,360
Nice pass.

221
00:12:46,679 --> 00:12:47,480
Don't underestimate them.

222
00:12:47,480 --> 00:12:48,000
Captain,

223
00:12:52,279 --> 00:12:53,360
we'll go.

224
00:13:09,879 --> 00:13:10,559
Nice!

225
00:13:59,840 --> 00:14:00,879
Everyone must be tired, right?

226
00:14:00,879 --> 00:14:01,639
Not at all!

227
00:14:01,639 --> 00:14:02,799
We're good!

228
00:14:02,799 --> 00:14:03,960
No problem, Captain!

229
00:14:03,960 --> 00:14:04,639
Okay.

230
00:14:05,039 --> 00:14:06,080
Let's go.

231
00:14:06,080 --> 00:14:06,840
Go!

232
00:14:07,440 --> 00:14:08,200
Catch the ball!

233
00:14:27,720 --> 00:14:38,200
Most Valuable Player!

234
00:14:39,320 --> 00:14:40,240
It's been a long time

235
00:14:40,240 --> 00:14:41,120
since I played like this.

236
00:14:41,279 --> 00:14:42,200
Let's celebrate.

237
00:14:42,200 --> 00:14:43,639
Come on.

238
00:14:43,960 --> 00:14:46,279
Cheers.

239
00:14:51,159 --> 00:14:51,840
Coach,

240
00:14:52,200 --> 00:14:53,399
actually, we

241
00:14:53,399 --> 00:14:54,879
contacted Changxia,

242
00:14:55,759 --> 00:14:56,440
but he

243
00:14:56,440 --> 00:14:58,120
has settled in another city,

244
00:14:58,399 --> 00:14:59,559
so he couldn't make it.

245
00:15:00,200 --> 00:15:00,840
He asked us

246
00:15:01,120 --> 00:15:02,559
to say sorry to you

247
00:15:02,559 --> 00:15:03,440
on his behalf.

248
00:15:07,399 --> 00:15:08,399
It's all in the past.

249
00:15:09,279 --> 00:15:10,960
I'm very happy that you can

250
00:15:10,960 --> 00:15:11,960
invite them here today.

251
00:15:11,960 --> 00:15:12,600
Really.

252
00:15:13,519 --> 00:15:14,759
As long as you invite us,

253
00:15:14,759 --> 00:15:16,159
we can come anytime.

254
00:15:16,159 --> 00:15:16,679
Right.

255
00:15:16,679 --> 00:15:17,519
Go through the north gate.

256
00:15:17,519 --> 00:15:18,720
I'm familiar with the north gate.

257
00:15:21,080 --> 00:15:21,840
Thank you all.

258
00:15:22,320 --> 00:15:24,399
I really like your gift.

259
00:15:29,440 --> 00:15:30,399
Next,

260
00:15:32,879 --> 00:15:33,879
let's take

261
00:15:33,879 --> 00:15:35,600
the momentum from the seniors

262
00:15:35,600 --> 00:15:36,960
to face Yudong.

263
00:15:45,320 --> 00:15:46,200
Do you have confidence?

264
00:15:46,200 --> 00:15:47,840
Yes!

265
00:15:47,840 --> 00:15:49,200
Yibei Basketball Club,

266
00:15:49,200 --> 00:15:52,960
go, go, go!

267
00:16:06,639 --> 00:16:07,480
It was here

268
00:16:07,679 --> 00:16:09,200
that I watched you play.

269
00:16:09,799 --> 00:16:10,720
Who knew we'd

270
00:16:10,720 --> 00:16:11,879
actually be teammates now?

271
00:16:12,360 --> 00:16:13,159
Isn't this

272
00:16:13,159 --> 00:16:14,600
just like a dream come true?

273
00:16:16,960 --> 00:16:18,440
You've been better than me for a while.

274
00:16:20,440 --> 00:16:23,279
I've always wanted to ask you,

275
00:16:24,240 --> 00:16:26,159
why did you decide to transfer to Yibei?

276
00:16:26,919 --> 00:16:28,639
I play basketball to have fun.

277
00:16:29,320 --> 00:16:31,200
But at the Middle School Affiliated to the Institute of Physical Education,

278
00:16:31,840 --> 00:16:33,799
everyone just wants to win.

279
00:16:35,000 --> 00:16:36,159
There's no joy in it.

280
00:16:37,480 --> 00:16:39,080
Until I met you again

281
00:16:40,039 --> 00:16:41,519
and saw everyone at Yibei,

282
00:16:41,879 --> 00:16:43,159
I finally realized

283
00:16:43,960 --> 00:16:45,519
this is how I want to play basketball.

284
00:16:46,399 --> 00:16:47,919
Do you really

285
00:16:48,480 --> 00:16:50,080
