287
00:16:52,320 --> 00:16:53,559
It's not that I don't care.

288
00:16:53,879 --> 00:16:55,200
Winning is definitely enjoyable.

289
00:16:55,879 --> 00:16:56,720
But

290
00:16:56,919 --> 00:16:58,559
