293
00:17:07,480 --> 00:17:08,400
Not at all.

294
00:17:08,640 --> 00:17:09,720
This is quite good.

295
00:17:10,079 --> 00:17:11,240
Only by relaxing your mindset

296
00:17:12,039 --> 00:17:13,559
can you better enjoy the game.

297
00:17:18,680 --> 00:17:19,519
What about you?

298
00:17:19,960 --> 00:17:21,640
You must want to win the next game, right?

299
00:17:24,279 --> 00:17:25,799
If it were in the past,

300
00:17:25,799 --> 00:17:27,039
I would definitely tell you

301
00:17:27,680 --> 00:17:28,839
