302
00:17:28,839 --> 00:17:29,799
you must win.

303
00:17:30,440 --> 00:17:31,599
Winning is meaningful,

304
00:17:31,920 --> 00:17:33,839
and losing means failure.

305
00:17:34,319 --> 00:17:35,279
What about now?

306
00:17:37,519 --> 00:17:38,920
Now,

307
00:17:39,319 --> 00:17:41,079
the result doesn't seem to be

308
00:17:41,079 --> 00:17:42,559
the standard for everything anymore.

309
00:17:48,759 --> 00:17:49,839
During this period,

310
00:17:49,839 --> 00:17:50,359
our team

311
00:17:50,359 --> 00:17:51,839
has been through so much together.

312
00:17:52,440 --> 00:17:53,720
We almost couldn't compete,

313
00:17:54,079 --> 00:17:55,559
and even faced disbandment.

314
00:17:56,279 --> 00:17:57,240
But in the end, we returned

315
00:17:57,240 --> 00:17:58,279
to the competition.

316
00:17:59,160 --> 00:18:01,039
For us,

317
00:18:01,359 --> 00:18:02,319
we have already won.

318
00:18:04,039 --> 00:18:06,359
So winning or losing doesn't matter.

319
00:18:07,799 --> 00:18:08,640
It does matter.

320
00:18:09,160 --> 00:18:11,640
But no matter the outcome,

321
00:18:11,640 --> 00:18:12,279
it can't stop us

322
00:18:12,279 --> 00:18:13,599
from moving forward.

323
00:18:15,160 --> 00:18:15,839
So,

324
00:18:17,200 --> 00:18:18,400
I won't be afraid anymore.

325
00:18:19,920 --> 00:18:21,400
Then I'll be with you

326
00:18:21,400 --> 00:18:22,359
no matter the outcome.

327
00:18:23,160 --> 00:18:23,559
Okay.

328
00:18:24,319 --> 00:18:24,799
Good luck.

329
00:18:24,799 --> 00:18:26,319
Secret weapon, Xie Yizhou.

330
00:18:27,440 --> 00:18:28,119
Fighting!

331
00:18:28,119 --> 00:18:29,160
My idol and captain,

332
00:18:29,279 --> 00:18:30,039
Gu Chenyang.

333
00:18:55,319 --> 00:18:56,240
Senior Zhou Yang,

334
00:18:58,039 --> 00:18:59,119
do you remember

335
00:18:59,400 --> 00:19:00,519
that you promised me to join the Basketball Club

336
00:19:00,759 --> 00:19:02,319
right here?

337
00:19:03,400 --> 00:19:04,359
Of course.

338
00:19:06,519 --> 00:19:07,759
I just didn't expect

339
00:19:08,640 --> 00:19:10,079
so many things would happen.

340
00:19:10,880 --> 00:19:12,079
Do you think

341
00:19:12,480 --> 00:19:13,519
there are more good things

342
00:19:14,640 --> 00:19:15,720
or bad things?

343
00:19:18,839 --> 00:19:19,599
As long as we

344
00:19:19,599 --> 00:19:21,000
experience it together,

345
00:19:21,480 --> 00:19:22,759
it will become a good thing.

346
00:19:31,160 --> 00:19:31,640
By the way,

347
00:19:32,599 --> 00:19:33,839
I have something for you.

348
00:19:37,000 --> 00:19:38,799
This is the badge of our basketball team.

349
00:19:39,160 --> 00:19:40,720
I specially ordered it for everyone.

350
00:19:42,359 --> 00:19:43,279
So cool!

351
00:19:43,640 --> 00:19:44,920
I'm sure everyone will like it.

352
00:19:45,759 --> 00:19:46,640
I hope wearing it

353
00:19:46,640 --> 00:19:47,400
will make our team

354
00:19:47,400 --> 00:19:48,319
stronger.

355
00:19:51,680 --> 00:19:52,519
Well,

356
00:19:53,200 --> 00:19:54,440
I'll give you a gift too.

357
00:19:55,279 --> 00:19:56,799
My favorite milk candies.

358
00:19:57,759 --> 00:19:58,400
Have some.

359
00:19:59,759 --> 00:20:00,400
Thanks.

360
00:20:13,319 --> 00:20:14,440
When

361
00:20:15,799 --> 00:20:16,400
will I

362
00:20:16,400 --> 00:20:17,680
be as thoughtful

363
00:20:18,200 --> 00:20:19,960
as you?

364
00:20:21,559 --> 00:20:22,519
Unlike me,

365
00:20:23,559 --> 00:20:25,599
who only knows to put candy in my pocket.

366
00:20:27,640 --> 00:20:29,319
Still thinking about being a brother?

367
00:20:31,920 --> 00:20:32,920
I think

368
00:20:33,160 --> 00:20:34,680
you don't have to be like me.

369
00:20:36,160 --> 00:20:36,920
Having a brother

370
00:20:36,920 --> 00:20:37,759
who can always produce candy

371
00:20:37,759 --> 00:20:38,799
is also cool.

372
00:20:39,599 --> 00:20:40,440
Really?

373
00:20:42,720 --> 00:20:43,640
Although you don't always

374
00:20:43,640 --> 00:20:44,920
think things through,

375
00:20:46,960 --> 00:20:47,960
your optimism

376
00:20:47,960 --> 00:20:49,640
is something no one can match.

377
00:20:50,319 --> 00:20:51,480
You're always so cheerful,

378
00:20:51,960 --> 00:20:53,119
just like this candy,

379
00:20:54,440 --> 00:20:55,920
bringing us all

380
00:20:55,920 --> 00:20:57,920
a constant stream of small joys.

381
00:21:01,079 --> 00:21:02,000
So,

382
00:21:02,640 --> 00:21:04,240
just be yourself.

383
00:21:07,680 --> 00:21:08,759
Be yourself.

384
00:21:18,599 --> 00:21:19,960
Lin Qingyuan,

385
00:21:19,960 --> 00:21:21,559
be yourself.

386
00:21:21,559 --> 00:21:24,079
Be a happy self.

387
00:21:24,319 --> 00:21:25,279
And be a

388
00:21:25,480 --> 00:21:27,279
super nice brother.

389
00:21:29,319 --> 00:21:30,279
Zhou Yang,

390
00:21:30,720 --> 00:21:32,720
be a better self.

391
00:21:33,440 --> 00:21:35,839
Be happy with mom forever.

392
00:21:40,200 --> 00:21:42,079
[You shouted here alone last time.]

393
00:21:42,759 --> 00:21:44,200
[This time, I'm with you.]

394
00:21:47,319 --> 00:21:48,559
[The game is about to start.]

395
00:21:51,920 --> 00:21:53,920
[Yibei Basketball Club,]

396
00:21:53,920 --> 00:21:55,960
[go for it!]

397
00:22:08,960 --> 00:22:09,839
Brother Yu,

398
00:22:09,839 --> 00:22:10,559
the dishes are all here.

399
00:22:10,559 --> 00:22:11,519
Order more if you want.

400
00:22:11,519 --> 00:22:12,279
Thank you.

401
00:22:15,839 --> 00:22:16,640
Chen Xiaosong,

402
00:22:17,160 --> 00:22:18,319
you're still growing.

403
00:22:18,319 --> 00:22:19,079
Eat more.

404
00:22:19,640 --> 00:22:20,400
Try this.

405
00:22:22,759 --> 00:22:23,440
Help yourself.

406
00:22:23,440 --> 00:22:24,240
It's on me.

407
00:22:31,240 --> 00:22:32,319
What are you thinking about?

408
00:22:32,839 --> 00:22:33,279
You've been

409
00:22:33,279 --> 00:22:34,519
looking preoccupied lately.

410
00:22:36,200 --> 00:22:37,440
I've noticed

411
00:22:37,640 --> 00:22:38,039
I'm getting

412
00:22:38,039 --> 00:22:39,680
more into basketball.

413
00:22:40,079 --> 00:22:41,559
Isn't that a good thing?

414
00:22:43,759 --> 00:22:45,400
I used to think

415
00:22:45,400 --> 00:22:47,200
my favorite thing was writing.

416
00:22:48,160 --> 00:22:50,519
Now, I play basketball more,

417
00:22:51,200 --> 00:22:52,160
write less,

418
00:22:52,319 --> 00:22:53,440
and have less inspiration.

419
00:22:54,799 --> 00:22:56,240
Do you think

420
00:22:56,240 --> 00:22:57,759
this is a punishment for betraying

421
00:22:57,759 --> 00:22:58,920
my dreams?

422
00:23:00,640 --> 00:23:02,039
You're overthinking.

423
00:23:02,799 --> 00:23:04,640
Life is long.

424
00:23:05,559 --> 00:23:07,079
If you only do one thing,

425
00:23:07,440 --> 00:23:09,119
wouldn't you feel bored?

426
00:23:09,119 --> 00:23:10,119
Don't forget

427
00:23:10,559 --> 00:23:11,319
my dream is

428
00:23:11,319 --> 00:23:11,920
to make the Pulsar Band

429
00:23:11,920 --> 00:23:13,039
famous all over the world.

430
00:23:13,799 --> 00:23:15,440
But that doesn't stop me from playing basketball.

431
00:23:21,039 --> 00:23:22,680
But what if

432
00:23:22,680 --> 00:23:24,240
they conflict one day?

433
00:23:28,000 --> 00:23:29,559
If they conflict,

434
00:23:29,839 --> 00:23:31,200
it depends on which one is more important

435
00:23:31,200 --> 00:23:32,319
which is more important.

436
00:23:32,759 --> 00:23:34,799
For me now,

437
00:23:35,000 --> 00:23:36,359
the competition is definitely more important.

438
00:23:36,720 --> 00:23:37,519
And you?

439
00:23:40,119 --> 00:23:41,079
Competition is important.

440
00:23:47,640 --> 00:23:48,599
Hello, Brother Xu.

441
00:23:48,599 --> 00:23:49,319
[Haoyu,]

442
00:23:49,640 --> 00:23:50,599
[good news.]

443
00:23:50,720 --> 00:23:52,559
[There's a New Star Music Project,]

444
00:23:52,559 --> 00:23:53,839
[a nationwide student band]

445
00:23:53,839 --> 00:23:55,079
[battle.]

446
00:23:55,480 --> 00:23:56,039
I showed them

447
00:23:56,039 --> 00:23:57,200
your video.

448
00:23:57,319 --> 00:23:58,799
They want to invite you.

449
00:23:58,920 --> 00:23:59,799
Really?

450
00:23:59,799 --> 00:24:00,799
When is it?

451
00:24:01,079 --> 00:24:01,799
This Saturday.

452
00:24:02,079 --> 00:24:03,079
Do you have time?

453
00:24:04,000 --> 00:24:05,319
This Saturday?

454
00:24:09,000 --> 00:24:10,319
We have a competition.

455
00:24:10,319 --> 00:24:11,440
I probably can't make it.

456
00:24:11,839 --> 00:24:13,039
Oh, I see.

457
00:24:13,039 --> 00:24:14,039
It's a rare opportunity.

458
00:24:14,039 --> 00:24:14,759
Think about it again.

459
00:24:14,759 --> 00:24:16,160
Give me an answer when you decide.

460
00:24:16,880 --> 00:24:17,720
Okay.

461
00:24:17,720 --> 00:24:18,640
Thank you, Xu.

462
00:24:18,640 --> 00:24:19,759
Bye.

463
00:24:21,519 --> 00:24:22,440
Peng Pai

464
00:24:23,559 --> 00:24:24,920
Then you won't go.

465
00:24:25,200 --> 00:24:26,680
I just said

466
00:24:26,720 --> 00:24:28,640
the competition is definitely the most important thing

467
00:24:28,640 --> 00:24:29,839
for me now.

468
00:24:30,839 --> 00:24:31,440
But that doesn't mean

469
00:24:31,880 --> 00:24:33,000
I gave up the band.

470
00:24:33,279 --> 00:24:35,200
So you're the same.

471
00:25:03,480 --> 00:25:04,200
Hello.

472
00:25:04,680 --> 00:25:05,319
Your iced water.

473
00:25:05,319 --> 00:25:06,359
Thank you.

474
00:25:08,759 --> 00:25:09,079
I told you

475
00:25:09,079 --> 00:25:10,720
there was something wrong with your thermos.

476
00:25:10,720 --> 00:25:11,680
Why are you here?

477
00:25:12,000 --> 00:25:13,559
I'm worried about you.

478
00:25:13,720 --> 00:25:14,599
So,

479
00:25:14,839 --> 00:25:15,599
you're keeping ice water

480
00:25:15,599 --> 00:25:16,960
in your thermos?

481
00:25:19,119 --> 00:25:19,920
Why?

482
00:25:20,240 --> 00:25:21,440
Is it because of your heart?

483
00:25:24,319 --> 00:25:25,200
Is it serious?

484
00:25:25,559 --> 00:25:26,720
Was it triggered by something

485
00:25:26,720 --> 00:25:28,319
online recently?

486
00:25:28,960 --> 00:25:30,119
Whether it's serious or not,

487
00:25:30,799 --> 00:25:32,440
the doctor will know best.

488
00:25:32,440 --> 00:25:34,000
Then you should go see a doctor quickly.

489
00:25:34,000 --> 00:25:35,440
I will.

490
00:25:35,680 --> 00:25:36,480
But

491
00:25:36,799 --> 00:25:38,519
I have to wait until the next competition is over.

492
00:25:39,440 --> 00:25:40,160
It's okay.

493
00:25:40,359 --> 00:25:41,640
This is for ice compress.

494
00:25:44,440 --> 00:25:45,480
So,

495
00:25:46,480 --> 00:25:47,920
you use ice water compress every day

496
00:25:47,920 --> 00:25:48,960
for us?

497
00:25:52,319 --> 00:25:53,519
For myself, too.

498
00:25:54,359 --> 00:25:55,799
I don't want to miss

499
00:25:56,240 --> 00:25:57,359
such a critical battle.

500
00:26:02,359 --> 00:26:03,880
What's that look?

501
00:26:04,480 --> 00:26:05,440
I'm fine.

502
00:26:07,680 --> 00:26:08,799
Congrats.

503
00:26:09,119 --> 00:26:10,440
You're the first to notice.

504
00:26:11,279 --> 00:26:13,000
Should I keep it a secret for you?

505
00:26:14,200 --> 00:26:15,279
No need.

506
00:26:16,319 --> 00:26:18,279
Telling or hiding it

507
00:26:18,720 --> 00:26:20,119
will just make them worry.

508
00:26:22,119 --> 00:26:23,400
Let it be.

509
00:26:25,759 --> 00:26:27,680
The basketball club really can't do without you.

510
00:26:28,480 --> 00:26:29,720
Even if you don't play,

511
00:26:29,720 --> 00:26:30,200
you're still

512
00:26:30,200 --> 00:26:31,559
our rock.

513
00:26:31,920 --> 00:26:33,799
Gu Chenyang and Zhou Yang

514
00:26:34,400 --> 00:26:35,000
feel more at ease

515
00:26:35,000 --> 00:26:36,640
when they see you.

516
00:26:38,160 --> 00:26:39,680
Your heart condition is indeed bad,

517
00:26:40,920 --> 00:26:42,680
but it's also because of you

518
00:26:42,680 --> 00:26:44,160
that everyone feels at ease.

519
00:26:47,559 --> 00:26:48,759
You're making it sound

520
00:26:49,079 --> 00:26:50,559
like you're mourning me.

521
00:26:50,920 --> 00:26:52,119
What are you talking about?

522
00:26:52,400 --> 00:26:53,400
Say "pish pish pish".

523
00:26:53,400 --> 00:26:54,519
Say it.

524
00:26:54,880 --> 00:26:56,720
Pish pish pish.

525
00:26:56,720 --> 00:26:57,680
That's enough.

526
00:27:06,759 --> 00:27:07,440
You've been

527
00:27:07,440 --> 00:27:08,680
smiling more and more lately.

528
00:27:10,440 --> 00:27:11,400
Fu Binyan,

529
00:27:13,160 --> 00:27:14,200
I'll be on the sidelines

530
00:27:14,599 --> 00:27:15,799
for the next game.

531
00:27:16,440 --> 00:27:18,119
If you feel unwell,

532
00:27:18,480 --> 00:27:19,559
just call me.

533
00:27:20,480 --> 00:27:21,759
I'll be there right away.

534
00:27:22,079 --> 00:27:22,759
Don't worry.

535
00:27:22,759 --> 00:27:23,640
I'm here for you.

536
00:27:25,359 --> 00:27:26,039
Okay.
